            <profile id="4589-1841-66c6-db86" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="aab0-aa1e-0319-4ffe" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapons. May have thrusting spear (+1 pt), bow (+2 pts), shield (+1 pt), light armour (+2 pts). Shields may be replaced with spara (+1 pt). Models in the unit can have different weapon combinations; archers in the second rank may shoot at full effect as long as the unit does not move. Immortals/Guard are stubborn. (Armies of Antiquity p.13)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
