                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Armed with javelins and shield, or bow. May have thrusting spears (+1 pt) or double-handed weapons (+1 pt). Light Infantry. (Armies of Antiquity p.13)</characteristic>
